# OPTIONAL — leave unset when using the Vercel /api rewrite (recommended).
#
# In development, Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:5000 automatically.
# In production, vercel.json proxies /api to the backend automatically.
#
# Only set this if you want the browser to call the backend directly instead
# of going through the /api proxy. Use the backend ORIGIN only (no /api suffix):
# VITE_API_URL=https://ecohand-api.onrender.com
